{"ID":"20240205153727-41hdoeg","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153727-41hdoeg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153727-41hdoeg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101447-bt2ryc8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165139-ikhgov5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101447-bt2ryc8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:146,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:146\u0026#125;","title":"麦芽","type":"doc","updated":"20240903093849"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206101447-bt2ryc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101447-bt2ryc8","updated":"20240206101458"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t全国各地均产。\n【性状】\t本品呈梭形，长812mm，直径34mm。表面淡黄色，背面为外稃包围，具5脉，先端长芒已断落；腹面为内稃包围。除去内外稃后，腹面有1条纵沟；基部胚根处生出幼芽及须根，幼芽长披针状条形，长约0.5cm。须根数条，纤细而弯曲。质硬，断面白色，粉性。无臭，味微甘。\n【性味】\t甘，平。\n【功效】\t行气消食，健脾开胃，退乳消胀。用于食积不消，脘腹胀痛，脾虚食少，乳汗郁积，乳房胀痛，妇女断乳，生麦芽健脾和胃通乳。用于脾虚食少，乳汗郁积。\n【炙品】\t炒麦芽：为净麦芽用文火炒至微黄入药者。行气消食回乳。用于食积不消，妇女断乳。\n焦麦芽：偏于消食化滞。用于食积不消，脘腹胀痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101449-hsbmeyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101449-hsbmeyh","updated":"20240206101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101449-px21yuy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162241-k5vgxtw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162241-k5vgxtw","updated":"20240205162241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"麦芽"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/麦芽-20240205162241-uz93jcg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705171505-2556r7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705171505-2556r7m","updated":"20240705171505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 367px;","style":"width: 357px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦2-20240704114232-31fw8fw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 357px;\" parent-style=\"width: 367px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦3-20240704114518-9pzu66m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 358px;\" parent-style=\"width: 368px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 262px;","style":"width: 252px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦4-20240704114547-x8a0aab.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 252px;\" parent-style=\"width: 262px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705171505-xjorfih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705171505-xjorfih","updated":"20240705171505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 497px;","style":"width: 487px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦7-20240704115206-o3t6uxb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 487px;\" parent-style=\"width: 497px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 372px;","style":"width: 362px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦8-20240704115335-78wddfx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 362px;\" parent-style=\"width: 372px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705171505-4t4q1r9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705171505-4t4q1r9","updated":"20240705171505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 422px;","style":"width: 412px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704115521-yrcikwl.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 412px;\" parent-style=\"width: 422px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 401px;","style":"width: 391px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704115507-s01jyrr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 391px;\" parent-style=\"width: 401px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 497px;","style":"width: 487px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704115558-8fkpemz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 487px;\" parent-style=\"width: 497px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705171505-6utdq4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705171505-6utdq4y","updated":"20240705171505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 454px;","style":"width: 444px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦5-20240704115035-0alnmsr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 444px;\" parent-style=\"width: 454px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 799px;","style":"width: 789px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦9-20240704115443-6eycx68.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 789px;\" parent-style=\"width: 799px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705171505-ae0p47y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705171505-ae0p47y","updated":"20240903093734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 607px;","style":"width: 597px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小麦"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小麦-20240828135623-e87j7oy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 597px;\" parent-style=\"width: 607px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 675px;","style":"width: 665px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240704115710-w54foht.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 665px;\" parent-style=\"width: 675px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705171521-3lw8l9t","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240705171521-3lw8l9t"}},{"ID":"20240903093836-5thtlwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-5thtlwg","updated":"20240903093849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：麦芽"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-ev96q95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-ev96q95","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦芽《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-kegfy7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-kegfy7h","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MàiYá"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-076lyxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-076lyxt","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】FRUCTUSHORDEIGERMINATUS"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-9ip0ffn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-9ip0ffn","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】大麦芽"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-47si0lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-47si0lr","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为禾本科植物大麦HordeumvulgareL.的成熟果实经发芽干燥而得。将麦粒用水浸泡后，保持适宜温、湿度，待幼芽长至约0.5cm时，晒干或低温干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-c7ukmh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-c7ukmh2","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈梭形，长8～12mm,直径3～4mm。表面淡黄色，背面为外稃包围，具5脉；腹面为内稃包围。除去内外稃后，腹面有1条纵沟；基部胚根处生出幼芽及须根，幼芽长披针状条形，长约0.5cm。须根数条，纤细而弯曲。质硬，断面白色，粉性。无臭，味微甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-nqz63fv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-nqz63fv","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】取本品10g，研碎，加无水乙醇30ml，超声处理40分钟，滤过，滤液加50％氢氧化钾溶液1ml，加热回流15分钟，置冰浴中冷却5分钟，移置分液漏斗中，用水20ml分次洗涤容器，洗液并入分液漏斗中，用石油醚（30～60℃）振摇提取3次，每次10ml，合并石油醚层，置45℃水浴上挥干，残渣加醋酸乙酯1ml使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取麦芽对照药材10g，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各10μl，分别点于同一以羧甲基纤维素钠为黏合剂的硅胶G薄层板上，以苯-氯仿（1:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以含15％硝酸的50％乙醇溶液，在100℃加热至斑点显色清晰，置紫外光灯（365nm）下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的荧光斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-8hir6ji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-8hir6ji","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-qnyzske","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-qnyzske","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦芽：除去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-8jrmm07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-8jrmm07","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒麦芽：取净麦芽，照清炒法（附录ⅡD）炒至棕黄色，放凉，筛去灰屑。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-77w8xic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-77w8xic","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"焦麦芽：取净麦芽，照清炒法（附录ⅡD）炒至焦褐色，放凉，筛去灰屑。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-lbwsecy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-lbwsecy","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-aceujax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-aceujax","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归脾、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-uu4nf6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-uu4nf6q","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-uvaje4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-uvaje4g","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"行气消食，健脾开胃，退乳消胀。用于食积不消，脘腹胀痛，脾虚食少，乳汁郁积，乳房胀痛，妇女断乳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-5u8zso5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-5u8zso5","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生麦芽：健脾和胃，疏肝行气。用于脾虚食少，乳汁郁积。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-5xsapeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-5xsapeh","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒麦芽：行气消食回乳。用于食积不消，妇女断乳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-mfja43g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-mfja43g","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"焦麦芽：消食化滞。用于食积不消，脘腹胀痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-8l3uxif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-8l3uxif","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】9～15g；回乳炒用60g。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-z7q0s9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-z7q0s9q","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-x6uvnsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-x6uvnsp","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-cze3674","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-cze3674","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦芽《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-hcnmoel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-hcnmoel","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-syt0ojs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-syt0ojs","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MàiYá"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-781pvdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-781pvdt","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】大麦蘖（《药性论》），麦蘖（《日华子本草》），大麦毛（《滇南本草》），大麦芽（《本草汇言》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-ovp0b6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-ovp0b6c","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为发芽的大麦颖果。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-9hi04ej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-9hi04ej","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】各地均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-hg3fucg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-hg3fucg","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制法】将大麦以水浸透，捞出置筐内，上盖蒲包，经常洒水，待芽长达3～5毫米时，取出晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-xjs734m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-xjs734m","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】果实呈梭形，长8～12毫米.直径2.5～3.5毫米。上端有长约3毫米的黄棕色幼芽，下端有须根数条，纤细而弯曲，长0.2～2.0厘米，少数无须根。表面黄色或淡黄棕色，背面为外稃包围，具5脉，腹面为内稃包围，有腹沟1条。剥除内外稃后，即为果皮。果皮淡黄色，膜质，种皮薄与果皮难分离，背面基部有长椭圆形的胚，淡黄白色，长3～5毫米，腹面中央有褐色纵沟1条。胚乳很大，乳白色，粉质。气无，味微甜。以色黄粒大，饱满，芽完整者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-lze77ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-lze77ki","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】麦芽含淀粉酶、转化糖酶、维生素B、脂肪、磷脂、糊精、麦芽糖、葡萄糖等。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-fgpyeio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-fgpyeio","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】麦芽因含消化酶及维生素B，有助消化作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-rx0by5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-rx0by5k","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-iqfd9n1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-iqfd9n1","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒麦芽：取麦芽置锅内微炒至黄色，取出放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-s7crd61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-s7crd61","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"焦麦芽：同上法炒至焦黄色盾，喷洒清水，取出晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-bbg0ph3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-bbg0ph3","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-cq3i4tt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-cq3i4tt","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-6027fcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-6027fcj","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药性论》：\"味甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-mo6ts77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-mo6ts77","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《汤液本草》：\"气温，味甘咸，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-lmvckb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-lmvckb6","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"味甘，性平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-fp07rcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-fp07rcm","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-nvu7me7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-nvu7me7","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入脾、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-xrf9dw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-xrf9dw1","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入脾、胃二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-sxwel1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-sxwel1d","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草汇言》：\"入足太阴、阳明，手阳明经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-w4d24my","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-w4d24my","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-r4486ih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-r4486ih","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"消食，和中，下气。治食积不消，脘腹胀满，食欲不振，呕吐泄泻，乳胀不消。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-zy6eli4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-zy6eli4","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《药性论》：\"消化宿食，破冷气，去心腹胀满。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-yktmzwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-yktmzwq","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《千金·食治》：\"消食和中，熬末令赤黑，捣作麨，止泄利，和清酢浆服之，日三夜一服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-wf5wik0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-wf5wik0","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"温中，下气，开胃，止霍乱，除烦，消痰，破癥结，能催生落胎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-6ig2ucf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-6ig2ucf","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《医学启源》：\"补脾胃虚，宽肠胃，捣细炒黄色，取面用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-m420cv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-m420cv9","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《滇南本草》：\"宽中，下气，止呕吐，消宿食，止吞酸吐酸，止泻，消胃宽膈，并治妇人奶乳不收，乳汁不止。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-ok4yl9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-ok4yl9a","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3～5钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-hrv6lyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-hrv6lyl","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-vnive2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-vnive2f","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《食性本草》：\"久食消肾，不可多食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-1tyyq0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-1tyyq0h","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《汤液本草》：\"豆蔻、缩砂、木瓜、芍药、五昧子、乌梅为之使。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-sp6z8sz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-sp6z8sz","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经琉》：\"无积滞，脾胃虚者不宜甩。’"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-147blxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-147blxb","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草正》：\"妇有胎妊者不宜多服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-ljokuyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-ljokuyi","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《药品化义》：\"凡痰火哮喘及孕妇，切不可用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-qj2qd07","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-qj2qd07","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-trvb0y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-trvb0y2","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①快膈进食：麦芽四两，神曲二两，白术、橘皮各一两。为末，蒸饼丸梧子大。每人参汤下三、五十丸。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-kbrcs4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-kbrcs4q","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治产后腹中鼓胀，不通转，气急，坐卧不安：麦蘖一合，末，和酒服食，良久通转。（《兵部手集方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-a03ijwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-a03ijwm","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治饱食便卧，得谷劳病，令人四肢烦重，嘿嘿欲卧，食毕辄甚：大麦蘖一升，椒一两（并熬），干姜三两。捣末，每服方寸匕，日三、四服。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-ag5nsku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-ag5nsku","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治产后发热，乳汁不通及膨，无子当消者：麦蘖二两，炒，研细末。清汤调下，作四服。（《丹溪心法》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-y72twb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-y72twb2","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】治疗急慢性肝炎:取大麦低温发芽的幼根（长约0.5厘米左右），干燥后磨粉制成糖浆内服，每次10毫升（内含麦芽粉15克），每日3次，饭后服。另适当加用酵母或复合维生素B片。一般以30天为一疗程，连服至治愈后再服一个疗程。治疗161例，有效108例，无效53例，有效率为67.1％。其中急性肝炎56例，有效48例；慢性肝炎105例，有效60例。服药后肝痛、厌食、疲倦、低温等症都有不同程度的改善，尤其对消除厌食更显着。有效病例的肝脏肿大大多有不同程度的缩小，转氨酶亦有不同程度的下降。服药后少数病人有口干、口苦、烦躁、腹泻等副作用。远期疗效有待继续观察。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-d8i3jsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-d8i3jsw","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-fiakxtq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-fiakxtq","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麦芽《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-vn6vhd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-vn6vhd9","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-5ck3xba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-5ck3xba","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出自《本草纲目》。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-xqit5xa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-xqit5xa","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《别录》麦糵附见穬麦下，而大麦下无之，则作糵当以穬为良也。今人通用，不复分别矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-87fbx0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-87fbx0p","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MàiYá"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-dgqgwm9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-dgqgwm9","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】Malt"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-95te3do","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-95te3do","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】大麦糵、麦糵、大麦毛、大麦芽。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-ygfiuu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-ygfiuu6","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-dgmftvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-dgmftvp","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为禾本科植物大麦的发芽颖果。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-m1l4599","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-m1l4599","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：HordeumvulgareL."}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-9ecn9q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-9ecn9q9","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】大麦越年生草本。秆粗壮，光滑无毛，直立，高50-100cm。叶鞘松驰抱茎；两侧有较大的叶耳；叶舌膜质，长1-2mm；叶片扁平，长9-20cm，宽6-20mm。穗状花序长3-8cm（芒除外），径约1.5cm小穗稠密，每节着生3枚发育的小穗，小穗通常无柄，长1-1.5cm（除芒外）；颖线状披针形，微具短柔毛，先端延伸成8-14mm的芒；外稃背部无毛，有5脉，顶端延伸成芳，芒长8-15cm，边棱具细刺，内稃与外稃等长。颖果腹面有纵沟或内陷，先端有短柔毛，成熟时与外稃粘着，不易分离，但某些栽培品种容易分离。花期3-4月，果期4-5月。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-hixaxku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-hixaxku","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-e5jz38z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-e5jz38z","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：我国各地普遍栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-c7xwok0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-c7xwok0","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：我国各地普遍栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-q5okqeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-q5okqeh","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】性状鉴别颖果两端狭尖略呈梭形，长8-15mm，直径2.5-1.5mm。表面淡黄色，背面浑圆，为外稃包围，具5枚，先端长芳已断落；腹面为内稃包围，有1条纵沟。除去内外稃后，基部胚根处长出胚芽及须根，胚芽长披针形，状线形，黄白色，长约5mm，须根数条，纤细而弯曲。质硬，断面白色，粉性。气无，味微甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-a9s3ayw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-a9s3ayw","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】麦芽主要含α-及β-淀粉酶（amylase），催化酶（catalyticase），过氧化异构酶（peroxidisomerase）等。另含大麦芽碱（hordenine），大麦芽胍碱（hordatine）A、B，腺嘌呤（ade-nine）胆碱（choline），蛋白质，氨基酸，维生素D、D、E，细胞色素（cytochrome）C。尚含麦芽毒毒，即白栝楼碱（candici-ne）。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-vpxc2nv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-vpxc2nv","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-r9cpxnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-r9cpxnz","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.助消化作用：本品含α和β淀粉酶。而淀粉是糖淀粉与胶淀粉的混合物。组成糖淀粉的葡萄糖分子以α-1，4甙键相连，且呈直链排列。胶淀粉是由若干个短直链缩合葡萄糖交叉排列。支链淀粉分子中除α-1，4甙键外还有α-1，6甙键。α与β淀粉酶可水解α-1，4甙键，对α-1，6甙键无作用。β淀粉酶能将糖淀粉完全水解成麦芽糖，α淀粉酶则使之分解成短直键缩合葡萄糖（即糊精），后者可再为β淀粉酶水解成麦芽糖。因此淀粉在α和β淀粉酶的作用下可分解成麦芽糖与糊精。麦芽煎剂对胃酸与胃蛋白酶的分泌似有轻度促进作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-nk4s2he","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-nk4s2he","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.降血糖作用：麦芽浸剂口服可使家兔与正常人血糖降低。麦芽渣水提醇沉精制品制成的5%注射液给兔注射200mg，可使血糖降低40%或更多，大多在7小时后才恢复。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-qx6z8f1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-qx6z8f1","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.抗真菌作用：本品所含的大麦碱A和B有抗真菌活性。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-ajlcmo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-ajlcmo5","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.抑制催乳素释入：生麦芽煎剂100-200g/d口服，可使健康人睡眠或灭吐灵试验时催乳素释放高峰受到抑制，这可能与妇女服用生麦芽汤回乳作用有关，对单纯乳溢症患者，可使乳溢消失或缓解，但灭吐灵试验反应高峰不受抑制，对有垂体催乳素瘤器质性病变的闭经--乳溢综合征无效。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-2hdzm79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-2hdzm79","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.其它作用：本品所含的大麦碱其药理作用类似麻黄碱。1.0mg／kg剂量能增强豚鼠子宫的紧张和运动，且随剂量的增加而增加。对新斯的明引起的猫支气管痉挛，可使之扩张，有效剂量为0.5-1.0mg／kg，但对正常猫的作用很小。还有对放射性的防护作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-jygi5pl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-jygi5pl","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】本品毒性小，但用作动物饲料大量摄入时，可能引起中毒，因其中含微量麦芽毒素。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-luw2qnj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-luw2qnj","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-tp7ezl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-tp7ezl7","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.炒麦芽：取麦芽置锅内微炒至黄色，取出放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-kbtml9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-kbtml9j","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.焦麦芽：同上法炒至焦黄色后，喷洒清水，取出晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-dy1sz8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-dy1sz8z","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.麸制：先将麸皮撒于锅内，待麸皮冒烟时，倒入净麦芽，用文火炒至表面呈黄色为度，取出，除去麸皮放凉。每1kg麦芽，用麸皮90g。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-two7wkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-two7wkt","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；平"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-14amiee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-14amiee","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】脾；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-hm05a6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-hm05a6m","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】消食化积；回乳。主食积不消；腹满泄泻；恶心哎吐；食欲不振；乳汁郁积；乳房胀痛"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-a1k1ud4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-a1k1ud4","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，10-15g，大剂量可用30-120g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-9o7uzwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-9o7uzwr","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-ocfhbd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-ocfhbd5","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《食性本草》：久食消肾，不可多食。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-vpi0iq3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-vpi0iq3","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《汤液本草》：豆蔻、缩砂、木瓜、芍药、五味子、乌梅为之使。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-6ubew58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-6ubew58","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草经疏》：无积滞，脾胃虚者不宜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-vkcinh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-vkcinh6","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草正》：妇有胎妊者不宜多服。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-laqzo5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-laqzo5w","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《药品化义》：凡痰火哮喘及孕妇，切不可用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-eh6njnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-eh6njnm","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】1.化积散(《北京市中药成方选集》)，功能消食滞，化痞积，治小儿宿食不化，积滞痞块，面色萎黄，不思饮食，腹大膨胀。2.化滞调中汤(《证治准绳·类方》)，治积滞胀满。3.消谷丸(《杂病源流犀烛·内伤外感门》)，治脾虚不能消化水谷，胸膈痞闷，腹胁膨胀，日久不愈，食减嗜卧，日无味者。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-cegivok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-cegivok","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-yip45mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-yip45mc","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《药性论》：消化宿食，破冷气，去心腹胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-lnh4ob1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-lnh4ob1","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.千金·食治》：消食和中。熬末令赤黑，捣作麨，止泄利，和清酢浆服之，日三夜一服。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-fcnb3ho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-fcnb3ho","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《日华子本草》：温中，下气，开胃，止霍乱，除烦，消痰，破症结，能催生落胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-tx0t116","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-tx0t116","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《医学启源》：补脾胃虚，宽肠胃，捣细炒黄色，取面用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-9s9asif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-9s9asif","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《滇南本草》：宽中，下气，止呕吐，消宿食，止吞酸吐酸，止泻，消胃宽膈，并治妇人奶乳不收，乳汁不止。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-xq3d6ab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-xq3d6ab","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草纲目》：麦糵、谷芽、粟糵，皆能消导米面诸果食积。观造饧者用之，可以类推。但有积者能消化，无积而久服，则消人元气也，不可不知。若久服者，须同白术诸药兼用，则无害。7.《本草经疏》：麦糵，功用与米糵相同，而此消化之力更紧，其发生之气，又能助胃气上升，行阳道而资健运，故主开胃补脾，消化水谷及一切结积冷气胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-2x7yect","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-2x7yect","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草汇言》：大麦芽，和中消食之药也。补而能利，利而又能补，如腹之胀满，膈之郁结，或饮食之不纳，中气之不利，以此发生之物而开关格之气，则效非常比也。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-hmass84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-hmass84","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《本草正》：麦芽，病久不食者，可借此谷气以开胃，元气中虚者，毋多用此以消肾。亦善催生落胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-lv7zcaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-lv7zcaa","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《药品化义》：大麦芽，炒香开胃，以除烦闷。生用力猛，主消麦面食积，症瘕气结，胸膈胀满，郁结痰涎，小儿伤乳，又能行上焦滞血。若女人气血壮盛，或产后无儿饮乳，乳房胀痛，丹溪用此二两，炒香捣去皮为末，分作四服立消，其性气之锐，散血行气，迅速如此，勿轻视之。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-hs20npx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-hs20npx","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草述》：谷、麦二芽俱能开发胃气，宣五谷味。第（麦芽）微咸能行上焦滞血，使营和而卫益畅，更能腐化水谷，且脾主湿，血和而湿行，湿行而脾运，尤非谷芽所可几也。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-h4mryyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-h4mryyw","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《本草求原》：凡麦、谷、大豆浸之发芽，皆得生升之气，达肝以制化脾土，故能消导。凡怫郁致成膨膈等症，（麦芽）用之甚妙，人知其消谷而不知其疏肝也。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-r4xs374","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-r4xs374","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《医学衷中参西录》：大麦芽，能入脾胃，消化一切饮食积聚，为补助脾胃之辅佐品，若与参、术、芪并用，能运化其补益之力，不至作胀满，为其性善消化，兼能通利二便，虽为脾胃之药，而实善舒肝气。夫肝主疏泄，为肾行气，为其力能舒肝，善助肝木疏泄以行肾气，故又善于催生。至妇人乳汁为血所化，因其善于消化，微兼破血之性，故又善回乳。入丸散剂可炒用，入汤剂皆宜生用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093836-xiduf04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093836-xiduf04","updated":"20240903093907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093837-8lp6dhk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240903093837-8lp6dhk","updated":"20240903093907"}},{"ID":"20240903093839-7ag7523","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093839-7ag7523","updated":"20240903093907"}}]}